<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Seize (245)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>seize &lt;item&gt; from &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>seize sword from Gnort
</pre>
<p>Takes something a player or a monster carries or wears, wherever they are 
in the world, and puts it in your inventory. They are told that you have 
taken it, and every seize is written to the log. Only from someone of a 
lower level than yours.
</p><p>Name the item with one word: because of a known bug, a name of two words 
(seize long sword from Gnort) isn't found.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Purge</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Transfer</a>
</pre>




</div>